summary.value:
This paper investigates the communication saving of unbiased compression on distributed optimization. The main contributions are: 

i) a communication lower bound of distributed optimization algorithms with (not necessarily independent) unbiased compression;

ii) a communication lower bound of distributed optimization algorithms with (independent) unbiased compression;

iii) refined analysis of ADIANA to show tightness of these bounds;

iv) discussions on the importance of independence to the communication saving.

